      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAREFOOT RASCAL (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from four tries. In the money last time at this track (25.65) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.75 lengths third. Looks well placed and should feature. RED HOT PENNY (3) continues to race in super honest form, hitting the frame five times on end before scoring an overdue win last time out (19.62) at Capalaba. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Looks suited and expected to run well. BEXLEY (2) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fourth (30.39) at Q Parklands latest. Form here sound including six wins. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Has ability and can atone. FINAL SHOT (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
